PHASE 14 — Homework, Speaking Scenarios, Reviews/Tests, Materials

Goal:
Build the learning assignment system.

Homework types:
- MCQ
- Reading
- Listening
- Writing
- Speaking

Scenario:
- Real-life speaking task
- Situation
- Prompt
- Time limit
- Keywords
- Model answer optional
- Student audio recording/upload
- Owner feedback

Review/Test:
- MCQ
- Matching
- Fill-in-the-blank / Complete the sentence
- Writing
- Speaking
- Manual override by Owner

Materials:
- Links
- YouTube/video
- PDF
- PowerPoint/file
- HTML material if supported

Owner pages:
- /owner/homework
- /owner/homework/new
- /owner/homework/[id]
- /owner/homework/[id]/submissions
- /owner/scenarios
- /owner/scenarios/new
- /owner/scenarios/[id]/submissions
- /owner/reviews
- /owner/reviews/new
- /owner/reviews/[id]/results
- /owner/materials

Student pages:
- /student/homework/[id]
- /student/homework/[id]/result
- /student/scenarios/[id]
- /student/scenarios/[id]/result
- /student/reviews/[id]
- /student/reviews/[id]/result
- /student/materials

Important:
- Student results must show what the student selected, not just A/B/C.
- Show correct answer if incorrect.
- Show teacher feedback.
- Manual override affects Owner view, Student view, and exports later.

Acceptance criteria:
- Owner creates homework.
- Student submits homework.
- Owner corrects homework.
- Student sees result.
- Owner creates scenario.
- Student records scenario.
- Owner gives feedback.
- Owner creates review/test.
- Student takes it.
- Manual override works.
- Materials can be assigned.

Manual test checklist:
- Create homework with all sections.
- Submit as student.
- Correct as Owner.
- Create scenario and submit recording.
- Create review/test and override answer.
- Assign material.

